low.func.def public target<amdgpu.gfx11.generic.core>(@target) abi(hal_kernel) @condition_across_call(%value: reg<amdgpu.vgpr>, %flag: reg<amdgpu.sgpr>) -> (reg<amdgpu.vgpr>) asm {
